79
00:05:27,790 --> 00:05:29,760
He's a prodigy of the Giant Spirit Sect.

80
00:05:29,870 --> 00:05:31,510
This fight will be worth watching.

81
00:05:31,270 --> 00:05:32,590
According to the rules,

82
00:05:32,750 --> 00:05:34,510
both duels need to be won.

83
00:05:35,350 --> 00:05:37,510
