117
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:31,630
Stand to the side.

118
00:07:33,750 --> 00:07:36,110
Mo Lihai cannot fight

119
00:07:36,470 --> 00:07:37,710
but you...

120
00:07:38,070 --> 00:07:40,310
I will tear you apart !

121
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:44,680
You !

122
00:07:44,670 --> 00:07:46,030
Come up.

123
00:07:55,470 --> 00:07:56,910
Vice-Commander Xuan,

124
00:07:56,670 --> 00:07:58,510
