125
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:00,590
I don't.

126
00:08:00,990 --> 00:08:02,110
However,

127
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:04,720
this young man will definitely place in the top 3.

128
00:08:04,790 --> 00:08:06,710
He might even win.

129
00:08:08,950 --> 00:08:11,230
A mere Peak Late stage Soul Transformation...

130
00:08:11,150 --> 00:08:13,750
Even among Demon Generals, he's just average.

131
00:08:14,070 --> 00:08:16,190
How can an outsider like him

132
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:18,110
possibly get first place ?

133
00:08:18,750 --> 00:08:21,200
Since Vice-Commander Huang doesn't believe it,

134
00:08:20,990 --> 00:08:22,510
