142
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:44,470
Fine,

143
00:08:44,230 --> 00:08:45,710
I'll take that bet.

144
00:08:47,110 --> 00:08:49,230
If he had also injured you,

145
00:08:49,750 --> 00:08:51,950
you wouldn't be making fun of him.

146
00:08:55,310 --> 00:08:56,390
I'll go !

147
00:08:59,350 --> 00:09:01,840
Ao Di
Demon General
Rank 150 000 Demonic Energy
(Late stage Soul Transformation)

148
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:01,590
Mo Lihai cannot fight

149
00:09:01,550 --> 00:09:03,830
