153
00:09:11,070 --> 00:09:12,590
The rules say that

154
00:09:13,110 --> 00:09:14,750
if you harm me,

155
00:09:14,950 --> 00:09:16,830
you'll be executed !

156
00:09:16,950 --> 00:09:18,320
You're noisy...

157
00:09:29,470 --> 00:09:31,550
Let's see how long you can dodge !

158
00:09:46,390 --> 00:09:47,750
You aren't

159
00:09:48,030 --> 00:09:49,590
a match for me.

160
00:09:49,670 --> 00:09:51,630
Ao Di isn't that strong.

161
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:53,590
If it was Shi Xiao,

162
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:55,160
he wouldn't have lasted a single move.

163
00:09:54,950 --> 00:09:56,040
Exactly !

164
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:57,710
How ridiculous !

165
00:10:03,590 --> 00:10:05,310
In order to win,

166
00:10:05,270 --> 00:10:06,030
he...

167
00:10:06,230 --> 00:10:07,950
he actually removed his armor

168
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:09,430
to use his Life-artifact !

169
00:10:27,910 --> 00:10:29,270
How could you possibly

170
00:10:29,470 --> 00:10:32,790
block my Demon Beast's Blood God Arrow !?

171
00:10:39,990 --> 00:10:40,830
You...

172
00:10:40,590 --> 00:10:41,830
You dare !?

173
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:52,510
Your Excellency,

174
00:10:52,270 --> 00:10:53,230
he broke the rules !

175
00:10:55,910 --> 00:10:56,830
Wang Lin !

176
00:10:56,750 --> 00:10:58,830
You have some nerve !

177
00:10:59,030 --> 00:11:01,510
The rules say I can't kill a Demon General.

178
00:11:01,710 --> 00:11:02,630
But...

179
00:11:02,910 --> 00:11:04,550
