180
00:11:05,470 --> 00:11:07,190
You severed his meridians

181
00:11:07,190 --> 00:11:08,950
and crippled him !

182
00:11:09,390 --> 00:11:10,750
And ?

183
00:11:16,990 --> 00:11:18,280
You won

184
00:11:18,350 --> 00:11:19,830
this duel !

185
00:11:21,310 --> 00:11:23,350
Ao Di's helper !

186
00:11:23,190 --> 00:11:24,830
I... forfeit !

187
00:11:24,990 --> 00:11:26,150
I forfeit !

188
00:11:26,990 --> 00:11:28,470
He forfeited just like that ?

189
00:11:28,230 --> 00:11:29,270
Yeah...

190
00:11:30,110 --> 00:11:34,520
1 day later

191
00:11:43,470 --> 00:11:46,150
The winner is Mo Lihai.

192
00:11:46,390 --> 00:11:48,350
After 4 matches,

193
00:11:48,590 --> 00:11:50,430
Mo Lihai advances to the second round.

194
00:11:50,790 --> 00:11:52,630
Brother Wang, go back to the residence to rest.

195
00:11:52,470 --> 00:11:54,950
I'll still rely on you for the later rounds.

196
00:11:55,670 --> 00:11:58,630
That guy just bullies people in the name of the Emperor.

197
00:11:58,630 --> 00:12:00,710
Once Brother Wang gains the Demon Emperor's favor,

198
00:12:00,630 --> 00:12:02,230
he won't dare to say a word !

199
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:06,910
Excuse me, excuse me.

200
00:12:12,910 --> 00:12:14,750
For her to seat beside the Demon Emperor...

201
00:12:15,590 --> 00:12:16,750
Could she be...

202
00:12:16,990 --> 00:12:18,710
The Demon Emperor's Sword Spirit !?

203
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:41,600
Note: Little Black = Number Four

204
00:12:37,350 --> 00:12:38,110
Master,

205
00:12:38,390 --> 00:12:39,870
let Little Xu handle this !

206
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:41,600
Little Black taught me a secret move,

207
00:12:41,350 --> 00:12:43,480
I guarantee I can make the opponent scram !

208
00:12:43,590 --> 00:12:45,750
Using him to buy a little time

209
00:12:46,190 --> 00:12:47,830
is a decent plan.

210
00:12:52,310 --> 00:12:54,230
The Sword Spirit of the Demon Emperor is actually...

211
00:12:54,390 --> 00:12:57,310
such a pretty little girl !

212
00:12:59,190 --> 00:13:03,030
Little beauty, Brother Xu is coming to dote on you !

213
00:13:03,270 --> 00:13:05,070
What a filthy creature !

214
00:13:05,190 --> 00:13:06,390
Get away !

215
00:13:10,430 --> 00:13:13,760
Note: Xu Liguo had fallen in love with the soul fragment of Mei Ji (in the artifact of the Giant Demon Clan Ancestor)

216
00:13:10,430 --> 00:13:13,750
Back then, because of that fiend, my love was denied.

217
00:13:13,510 --> 00:13:16,510
Fortunately, the heavens are blessing me today !

218
00:13:18,710 --> 00:13:19,870
Don't be like that,

219
00:13:19,790 --> 00:13:20,990
we're both Sword Spirits.

220
00:13:20,790 --> 00:13:22,830
We are fated for each other.

221
00:13:29,950 --> 00:13:31,630
Disgusting !

222
00:13:33,070 --> 00:13:34,350
Don't go !

223
00:13:34,110 --> 00:13:36,230
You haven't finished your candied hawthorn yet !

224
00:13:34,110 --> 00:13:37,800
Note: candied hawthorn is the snack she was eating, it has a connotation of romance.

225
00:13:37,590 --> 00:13:38,670
My... my...

226
00:13:38,430 --> 00:13:40,550
My little beauty !!!

227
00:13:45,350 --> 00:13:47,950
My little beauty and I were about to get together

228
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:48,820
and you...

229
00:13:48,590 --> 00:13:50,230
you tore us apart !

230
00:13:50,190 --> 00:13:51,030
Wang Lin,

231
00:13:50,990 --> 00:13:53,110
back then, you denied my love for the beauty in that artifact,

232
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:55,150
and now you're stopping me from pursuing this love !

233
00:13:54,910 --> 00:13:57,310
You're just jealous of my dashing looks

234
00:13:57,070 --> 00:13:58,270
because you're all alone

235
00:13:58,030 --> 00:13:59,270
and can't stand to see others happy !

236
00:13:59,030 --> 00:14:00,320
Is that all ?

237
00:14:00,110 --> 00:14:01,030
I'm not done !

238
00:14:00,950 --> 00:14:03,590
Unless you let me out to find the little beauty I...

239
00:14:04,190 --> 00:14:05,270
My little beauty !

240
00:14:05,030 --> 00:14:06,830
Big brother is coming !

241
00:14:07,310 --> 00:14:08,470
As expected...

242
00:14:08,790 --> 00:14:11,600
My old restriction isn't strong enough to restrain him.

243
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:17,430
Wang Lin...

244
00:14:17,510 --> 00:14:19,350
You're forcing my hand !

245
00:14:19,390 --> 00:14:20,430
Little Black,

246
00:14:20,190 --> 00:14:21,230
come out !

247
00:14:21,830 --> 00:14:23,310
Release the restriction immediately

248
00:14:23,070 --> 00:14:24,070
or else...

249
00:14:28,430 --> 00:14:32,350
The fiend's strength is getting more and more terrifying...

250
00:14:32,350 --> 00:14:33,870
But I will fight

251
00:14:33,990 --> 00:14:35,110
for my love !

252
00:14:34,870 --> 00:14:36,070
Little Black !

253
00:14:49,910 --> 00:14:50,550
Mas...

254
00:14:50,470 --> 00:14:51,230
Mas...

255
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:53,000
Master...

256
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:54,550
Are you done ?

257
00:14:55,870 --> 00:14:57,630
Master's cultivation is heavenly,

258
00:14:57,390 --> 00:14:59,670
Little Xu will never dare to betray you again.

259
00:15:05,390 --> 00:15:06,750
Master is so wise !

260
00:15:06,670 --> 00:15:09,270
I swear I'll never go find the little beauty again.

261
00:15:09,430 --> 00:15:11,710
Sky Demon City is filled with powerful experts.

262
00:15:11,790 --> 00:15:14,230
Did you think no one would see you ?

263
00:15:14,430 --> 00:15:15,830
With your strength,

264
00:15:15,710 --> 00:15:18,030
