268
00:15:26,470 --> 00:15:27,830
Master is right !

269
00:15:27,630 --> 00:15:30,030
From now on, Little Xu will definitely get rid of his desires

270
00:15:29,790 --> 00:15:31,520
and will never have wicked thoughts !

271
00:15:31,590 --> 00:15:33,400
Both you and the half-moon blade

272
00:15:33,350 --> 00:15:35,430
have learned quite a few skills.

273
00:15:36,790 --> 00:15:38,870
Little Black has many techniques.

274
00:15:38,630 --> 00:15:40,230
It can conceal its aura,

275
00:15:39,990 --> 00:15:42,440
and can even enhance the strength of a celestial sword.

276
00:15:43,270 --> 00:15:44,910
Cultivating them isn't easy...

277
00:15:45,070 --> 00:15:47,350
Master, please be merciful and let it stay.

278
00:15:53,670 --> 00:15:54,990
My little beauty...

279
00:15:55,270 --> 00:15:58,070
I wonder when we will meet again...

280
00:16:01,830 --> 00:16:02,670
Lord Wang,

281
00:16:02,710 --> 00:16:04,920
someone wishes to see you in the courtyard.

282
00:16:08,990 --> 00:16:10,640
The name of fellow cultivator Wang

283
00:16:10,430 --> 00:16:13,030
was already famous back on planet Tian Yun.

284
00:16:13,230 --> 00:16:15,830
I came here to express my gratitude.

285
00:16:16,590 --> 00:16:18,110
In today's Demon General competition

286
00:16:18,430 --> 00:16:19,880
you helped us understand

287
00:16:19,630 --> 00:16:21,270
how a cultivator should be.

288
00:16:21,590 --> 00:16:22,800
You flatter me.

289
00:16:23,630 --> 00:16:25,110
In the Demon Spirit Land,

290
00:16:25,310 --> 00:16:27,510
our lives are worthless.

291
00:16:27,590 --> 00:16:29,030
Demon Generals cannot be killed

292
00:16:28,990 --> 00:16:31,430
but helpers can be slaughtered.

293
00:16:31,790 --> 00:16:33,230
Only fellow cultivator Wang

294
00:16:33,270 --> 00:16:35,630
was able to repay them for that.

295
00:16:35,830 --> 00:16:37,480
Although military merit is important,

296
00:16:37,230 --> 00:16:39,040
we must be able to live through it !

297
00:16:38,830 --> 00:16:40,320
But this competition

298
00:16:40,110 --> 00:16:41,950
is just a way for them

299
00:16:41,790 --> 00:16:43,110
to sharpen their blades.

300
00:16:43,190 --> 00:16:45,470
Cultivators should act according to the situation,

301
00:16:45,230 --> 00:16:46,830
not obstinate over futile things.

302
00:16:47,190 --> 00:16:49,600
We have decided to withdraw from the competition.

303
00:16:49,390 --> 00:16:51,840
We came specially to bid farewell to fellow cultivator Wang.

304
00:16:56,510 --> 00:16:58,550
The Demon Generals are watching me like tigers.

305
00:16:58,910 --> 00:17:00,950
Jin Wuxu kept targeting me.

306
00:17:01,390 --> 00:17:03,510
This rule that Demon Generals can't be killed

307
00:17:03,990 --> 00:17:06,710
might as well be my death sentence.

308
00:17:08,270 --> 00:17:10,030
Act according to the situation...

309
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:11,910
Perhaps...

310
00:17:12,230 --> 00:17:14,230
they are right.

311
00:17:50,510 --> 00:17:51,390
Ming Xuan,

312
00:17:51,830 --> 00:17:52,830
continue.

313
00:18:30,710 --> 00:18:33,750
From Qi Condensation all the way to Peak Late stage Soul Transformation,

314
00:18:34,190 --> 00:18:35,230
which step

315
00:18:35,790 --> 00:18:38,030
wasn't reached out of a desperate situation ?

316
00:18:37,790 --> 00:18:39,990
Cultivators should act according to the situation,

317
00:18:39,750 --> 00:18:41,190
not obstinate over futile things.

318
00:18:41,670 --> 00:18:43,350
If I had followed the will of the heavens,

319
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:45,550
I wouldn't be alive today.

320
00:18:57,790 --> 00:18:58,830
Withdrawing

321
00:19:01,990 --> 00:19:03,310
is not an option,

322
00:19:03,990 --> 00:19:05,230
it's a grave.

323
00:19:11,990 --> 00:19:13,640
Defy the heavens with my actions.

324
00:19:17,590 --> 00:19:19,510
Defy the heavens by cultivating.

325
00:19:25,630 --> 00:19:27,470
Cultivate to defy.

326
00:19:30,790 --> 00:19:32,830
Cultivate for freedom.

327
00:19:34,390 --> 00:19:35,710
This is...

328
00:19:39,670 --> 00:19:41,150
my Dao !

329
00:19:54,790 --> 00:19:56,030
Defying

330
00:19:56,470 --> 00:19:58,950
is my path to the Ascendant realm.

331
00:20:00,070 --> 00:20:01,750
Such a Dao Heart...

332
00:20:02,390 --> 00:20:03,870
Perhaps he is the person

333
00:20:03,910 --> 00:20:06,030
the Ancestor has been waiting for.

334
00:20:26,710 --> 00:20:28,700
Accept your fate and stay mortal

335
00:20:29,470 --> 00:20:31,560
or defy it to become immortal !

336
00:20:34,940 --> 00:20:37,190
The heavens can't shake my Dao Heart

337
00:20:37,730 --> 00:20:39,980
so they will try to eradicate my existence !

338
00:20:40,530 --> 00:20:42,780
They can destroy my body,

339
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:45,900
but they can't destroy my Dao Heart !

340
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:57,290
If the heavens want to kill me...

341
00:20:58,150 --> 00:20:59,740
I will...

342
00:20:59,870 --> 00:21:01,920
destroy the heavens !

343
00:21:22,210 --> 00:21:24,960
Those who disturb my Ascendant breakthrough

344
00:21:25,040 --> 00:21:27,290
must die !

345
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:49,210
Whoever wishes to kill me

346
00:21:49,300 --> 00:21:51,550
shall be trapped in my Underworld River,

347
00:21:51,990 --> 00:21:54,240
my own reincarnation cycle

348
00:21:54,760 --> 00:21:57,600
free from the heavens and the earth !
